        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The threeTOGO MRS contexts explicitly nameLab-Lemco(Oxoid) at10g. This is the manufacturer's beef-extract product, not chemically pure beef tissue, casein or a peptone inferred from usage. The current Lab_Lemco_Powder source owner fromKGcase182 is a useful product candidate; its manufacturer/catalogue and cross-source applicability require explicit reconciliation. The valid official Oxoid LP0029 specification independently recovered for KG case182 identifies Lab-Lemco powder as the Oxoid beef-extract product. The attempted L0029B page is a SKU_NOT_FOUND wrapper, not product evidence. Link these three explicit Oxoid occurrences to the same complete product proposal prepared for case182; do not invent an anatomical beef mapping.",
