        "reasoning": "DSMZ581 specifies5g Cornsteep powder in Glycerol Cornsteep Agar, alongside separate yeast extract, beef extract and casein peptone. Both admitted source and original PDF establish the dry corn-steep product class but give no vendor, drying process or lot composition. The current UNMAPPED_0366 is the matching powder placeholder. A liquid corn-steep liquor record or a carbohydrate/protein molecule would erase the stated physical mixture form. Completeness reassessment: Original DSMZ581 and admitted MediaDive ingredient2075 explicitly identify corn steep powder as a5g medium ingredient. Preserve this process-derived powder as its own undefined complex material. No vendor, drying process, fixed chemical composition or equivalence to a particular corn-steep-liquor concentrate is asserted. The absence of a fixed molecular formula does not prevent a source-defined material registry identity. An isolated guarded existing-owner promotion now supplies the exact registry identity and supported material scope.",
