        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "JCM1362 and1429 explicitly reference JCM265 Wolfe mineral stock. JCM265 adds NiCl2·6H2O0.02 g, Na2SeO3 0.001 g and Na2WO4·2H2O0.01 g to1 L JCM151 trace minerals. This is an NTA-based modified recipe; existing EDTA-based MIM Wolfe/ATCC stocks and Modified Wolfes Minerals have materially different compositions. The receiving doses10 and1 ml must stay occurrence-specific. Current exact proposal basis: JCM265 explicitly adds0.02g NiCl2·6H2O,0.001g Na2SeO3 and0.01g Na2WO4·2H2O to1.0L of prepared JCM151 trace minerals. The nested stock is an aliquot; its complete source batch made with1L added water is not flattened into the aliquot. JCM151 literal formula and competing existing owners are retained in primary evidence and ownership-conflict artifact. Component identity is established as this source stock; catalog ownership is not guessed. The full named source preparation is scientifically identified. Raw local names and bare numbered pointers are preserved as REJECTED_LABEL, not global resolver aliases; each original occurrence receives only its explicit source-qualified assignment. Component grounding, variable titrant amounts and unrelated release assertions retain their stated boundaries.",
