        "applicability": "Reviewed every one of the 2 original occurrences and complete frozen recipe objects. The following occurrence_bindings retain exact labels, nested/root location, original amount and source IDs; primary claims apply only to their explicit recipe/stock chain. The case-level native occurrence count is not replaced with any helper constant.",
