        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "JCM1412 uses10 ml of the explicitly referenced JCM265 Wolfe mineral stock: JCM151 trace minerals1 L plus NiCl2·6H2O20 mg, Na2SeO3 1 mg and Na2WO4·2H2O10 mg. The curly apostrophe is an orthographic variation within this explicit source reference; identity is supported with the JCM1362/1429 stock context, not with existing compositionally different MIM Wolfe stocks. Current exact proposal basis: JCM265 explicitly adds0.02g NiCl2·6H2O,0.001g Na2SeO3 and0.01g Na2WO4·2H2O to1.0L of prepared JCM151 trace minerals. The nested stock is an aliquot; its complete source batch made with1L added water is not flattened into the aliquot. JCM151 literal formula and competing existing owners are retained in primary evidence and ownership-conflict artifact. Component identity is established as this source stock; catalog ownership is not guessed. The full named source preparation is scientifically identified. Raw local names and bare numbered pointers are preserved as REJECTED_LABEL, not global resolver aliases; each original occurrence receives only its explicit source-qualified assignment. Component grounding, variable titrant amounts and unrelated release assertions retain their stated boundaries.",
