        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "KAl(SO4)2 source1722 CAS10043-67-1 agrees with anhydrous potassium aluminium sulfate CHEBI86463. The current Alk_So42 owner represents that substance, distinct from twelve-water alum. Two active owner tokens, Na SiO .9H O and ZnSO .7H O, contain different elements and are not names of this K/Al sulfate; they require source-preserving rejection in the coordinated shared owner proposal. This source case does not authorize complete owner release.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Assessment applies only to mediadive mediadive.ingredient:1722 and frozen raw record {\"amount\": 0.01, \"compound\": \"KAl(SO4)2\", \"compound_id\": 1722, \"g_l\": 0.01, \"optional\": 0, \"recipe_order\": 9, \"unit\": \"g\"}. Frozen occurrences=1 has definition 'helper constant; not measured recipe frequency'; it is not reinterpreted as recipe frequency. Live ingredient/recipe records are explicit primary comparisons, not replacements for the frozen input. All existing WITHHOLD, REJECTED_LABEL and source-material obligations remain; no complete owner or export approval is inferred.",
