        "applicability": "All 1 original occurrences were reviewed in their complete frozen recipe contexts. Evidence applies to the exact preserved source label 'MgSO4 . 2H2O'; source component, stock, salt, hydration and charge scopes are interpreted only as stated in the case reasoning. No inherited hold or downstream identity authorization is removed.",
