        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "NBRC223 explicitly supplies Fe2(SO4)3·(NH4)2SO4·24H2O. Reducing the entire double formula by two gives NH4Fe(SO4)2·12H2O. Sigma F3629 confirms ferric ammonium sulfate dodecahydrate/CAS7783-83-7. NLM MeSH M0141705 specifically denotes ammonium ferric sulfate dodecahydrate, distinct from descriptor C049467 and its anhydrous preferred concept. Select the exact M concept. TOGO M1451 incorrectly labels the raw ferric formula iron(II), which must not override source/supplier stoichiometry.",
        "missing_requirement": "Correct the TOGO ferrous annotation separately; native exact-term eligibility/label validation remains required for integration.",
        "applicability": "Case index 71: all 1 original occurrences and complete frozen recipe snapshots were read. NBRC223 explicitly supplies Fe2(SO4)3·(NH4)2SO4·24H2O. Reducing the entire double formula by two gives NH4Fe(SO4)2·12H2O. Sigma F3629 confirms ferric ammonium sulfate dodecahydrate/CAS7783-83-7. NLM MeSH M0141705 specifically denotes ammonium ferric sulfate dodecahydrate, distinct from descriptor C049467 and its anhydrous preferred concept. Select the exact M concept. TOGO M1451 incorrectly labels the raw ferric formula iron(II), which must not override source/supplier stoichiometry. Evidence from another recipe or manufacturer is used only for the stated chemical/form comparison, never to replace missing source recipe context. All frozen downstream/native holds remain in force.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
