        "applicability": "All 1 frozen occurrences and full recipe snapshots reviewed. TOGO M2313 explicitly names larch arabinogalactan as an alternative carbon substrate at0.2%, with percent basis unspecified. Larch provenance differentiates the material from unrestricted arabinogalactan. Sigma primary botanical material confirms that larch-wood arabinogalactan is a meaningful purchasable material; its catalogue, assay, species and extraction process are not assigned to this recipe. The closest verified ontology parent is CHEBI27569 arabinogalactan; natural-polymer identity is not decomposed into free monosaccharides. Exact occurrence scope is preserved; source transcription/receiving-medium errors remain separate publication holds. No downstream release, synchronization or rebuild is approved.",
