        "reasoning": "The original DSMZ1113 PDF separately names100mL Leptospira Enrichment EMJH and2.3g Difco medium base. The lookup found the base placeholder but no enrichment owner. The manufacturer-authored Difco/BBL manual names albumin and polysorbate80 plus unspecified additional growth factors. A source-qualified enrichment owner with these two known components and PARTIAL completeness is proposed, without a catalogue-version claim, guessed albumin species, constituent quantities, solvent or identity with the base.",
