        "reasoning": "The source VOSO4 x5H2O and exact CHEBI132758 support the existing pentahydrate owner. MediaDive277 lists CAS12439-96-2 whereas the owner carries CAS14708-82-8; that source/owner CAS discrepancy is explicitly retained and not treated as concordant or resolved by this alias-only proposal. Full payload review found a0.01%w/v stock token and bare VOSO4 presented as resolving synonyms. The proposal retains those strings and sources as REJECTED_LABEL, because they do not unconditionally name the neat five-water salt. The literal weighed source ingredient remains supported.",
