        "applicability": "Issue1201 continuation of this exact frozen source case. The source VOSO4 x5H2O and exact CHEBI132758 support the existing pentahydrate owner. MediaDive277 lists CAS12439-96-2 whereas the owner carries CAS14708-82-8; that source/owner CAS discrepancy is explicitly retained and not treated as concordant or resolved by this alias-only proposal. Full payload review found a0.01%w/v stock token and bare VOSO4 presented as resolving synonyms. The proposal retains those strings and sources as REJECTED_LABEL, because they do not unconditionally name the neat five-water salt. The literal weighed source ingredient remains supported. Helper/incident-edge count definitions, original source ID and raw label are unchanged. Every inherited nonpositive row decision, source placeholder and downstream hold remains in force. Scope-specific proposals do not approve generic labels globally or release complete owner/export payloads.",
