        "missing_requirement": "The composed proposal rejects all three stock-solution synonyms; that correction is concrete but unapplied. The complete successor also concretely rejects the underqualified bare formula and generic hydrate aliases; complete owner/coordinator release review remains. Preserve the frozen 392 G_PER_L occurrence as an unresolved source-unit/stock-context discrepancy against primary 392 mg in a trace stock; do not repair receiving-medium units by inference.",
