        "reasoning": "(NH4)2Fe(SO4)2·6H2O directly specifies Mohr salt, CHEBI76181. Original JCM950/966 both list 2.0 mg of this salt, corroborated by TOGO M997/M1016. The frozen G_PER_L unit must not be inherited as if the original 2 mg addition were grams. Identity aliasing preserves six waters and does not approve recipe unit flattening.",
