        "reasoning": "MediaDive106 independently attaches CAS7783-85-9 and a six-water formula to its bare Fe(NH4)2(SO4)2 name, supporting the existing Mohr-hexahydrate interpretation at this source. Expanded lookup also finds the anhydrous and seven-water owners, so bare text is not treated as a universal hydrate alias. Full owner inspection found three concentration-qualified stock tokens incorrectly accepted as hydrate synonyms; the complete selected successor preserves those stock tokens as REJECTED_LABEL and also retires the two underqualified global aliases. Supported occurrence-specific CAS/form reasoning remains distinct from global resolver scope.",
