        "reasoning": "NBRC885 identifies Difco Bacto Nutrient Broth at8g/L, with sodium carbonate separately added. OLS MICRO0000082 describes the Difco 3g beef-extract/5g peptone formula. This contradicts equating the input with Oxoid Nutrient Broth No.2; the existing No.2 owner's mixed supplier aliases require separation before reuse. ATCC3 primary formula now corroborates the Difco8g/L preparation and supports a concrete supplier/source-specific powder candidate, while the competingOxoidNo2 owner and liquid-ontology relation remain explicit integration conditions.",
        "missing_requirement": "Catalog234000 is primary comparator, not silently added toNBRC885. Integration must resolve competing Nutrient_Broth_No_2 aliases and decide exact/broad ontology relation for the supplier powder before release; registry candidate is source-specific, not a new generic nutrientbroth concept.",
        "applicability": "Exact frozen culturemech case 'Bacto Nutrient Broth (Difco)'; raw label preserved as 'Bacto Nutrient Broth (Difco)'. All 1 complete frozen recipe occurrences and their primary-source contexts are included individually; numerical discrepancies stay source-bound. NBRC885 identifies Difco Bacto Nutrient Broth at8g/L, with sodium carbonate separately added. OLS MICRO0000082 describes the Difco 3g beef-extract/5g peptone formula. This contradicts equating the input with Oxoid Nutrient Broth No.2; the existing No.2 owner's mixed supplier aliases require separation before reuse. ATCC3 primary formula now corroborates the Difco8g/L preparation and supports a concrete supplier/source-specific powder candidate, while the competingOxoidNo2 owner and liquid-ontology relation remain explicit integration conditions.",
