        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The source explicitly qualifies arabinan by sugar-beet origin. The current Arabinan_From_Sugar_Beet owner preserves that source and CAS11078-27-6 with an asymmetric CHEBI22590 arabinan parent; manufacturer P-ARAB independently corroborates the botanical material and CAS. Add the parenthesized source-qualified alias without erasing origin or changing the resolved #312 parent decision. This does not assert a specific Megazyme product/grade was used in M2313. Togo M2313 original prose explicitly identifies the sugar-beet arabinan option at0.2%; its other carbon sources are alternatives, not co-components.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Applies to exact culturemech source case 'arabinan (sugar beet)', raw label 'arabinan (sugar beet)'. All 1 frozen occurrences were read, including full recipe context; the source IDs, doses, nested stock paths and preparation qualifiers remain in the bound input and occurrence assessment. The source explicitly qualifies arabinan by sugar-beet origin. The current Arabinan_From_Sugar_Beet owner preserves that source and CAS11078-27-6 with an asymmetric CHEBI22590 arabinan parent; manufacturer P-ARAB independently corroborates the botanical material and CAS. Add the parenthesized source-qualified alias without erasing origin or changing the resolved #312 parent decision. This does not assert a specific Megazyme product/grade was used in M2313. Current primary Togo API recipe inspected where referenced; raw names outrank inferred GMO annotations and nested preparation structure is retained.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
