        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "Double distillation is an explicit preparation qualifier. MediaDive ingredient1021 names double distilled water and its filtered/anaerobic variants; CHEBI15377 supplies only the water molecular parent. The Distilled_Water owner explicitly rejects Double distilled water as an exact alias. Propose a separate material registry identity with broad water parent, preserving that rejection and without adding generic purified/tap-water synonyms.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Applies to exact culturemech source case 'Double-distilled water', raw label 'Double-distilled water'. All 1 frozen occurrences were read, including full recipe context; the source IDs, doses, nested stock paths and preparation qualifiers remain in the bound input and occurrence assessment. Double distillation is an explicit preparation qualifier. MediaDive ingredient1021 names double distilled water and its filtered/anaerobic variants; CHEBI15377 supplies only the water molecular parent. The Distilled_Water owner explicitly rejects Double distilled water as an exact alias. Propose a separate material registry identity with broad water parent, preserving that rejection and without adding generic purified/tap-water synonyms. Current primary Togo API recipe inspected where referenced; raw names outrank inferred GMO annotations and nested preparation structure is retained.",
        "source_observations": null
