        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "MediaDive S2474 explicitly adds S5688, also named by DSMZ1245. The stock contains multiple sugars, pectin/starch, sodium pyruvate and thiamine pyrophosphate. Both the original DSMZ PDF and S5688 repeat Maltose 8 g in successive rows. Preserve a distinct stock identity; do not silently sum, delete or replace one maltose row. A partial qualitative component proposal is possible while the maltose amount remains unresolved.",
