        "reasoning": "JCM1231 explicitly defines BG-FPC as a nested stock of NaNO3, MgSO4·7H2O, CaCl2·2H2O, disodium EDTA, a separately defined trace-mineral mix and water. The frozen TOGO occurrence has 10 G_PER_L, whereas JCM specifies 10 ml stock addition. Propose source-bound stock identity and direct components, preserving the nested trace mix; flag the upstream dose-unit problem rather than treating the stock as any constituent.",
