        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The label2-Oxoglutarate names an anion, and live CHEBI:16810 defines the dianion from both carboxyl-group deprotonations. Under the repository's bare-anion protonation rule, this is the appropriate neutral-medium species; it is not exact identity to alpha-ketoglutaric acid30915. The14.6g stock amount may derive from weighed acid, so that supplied-form and stock context remains separate and unresolved.",
