        "reasoning": "Completed actual five-occurrence trace rather than deferring it. Historical/current occurrence outputs and six full local recipes show five exact Mg-citrate rows from DSMZ354/solution694/compound404, including two variants and KOMODO; sixth broader Magnesium citrate row is independently BD220908 with an erroneous hydroxide localID and is excluded. Original DSMZ354 merely says Mg-citrate. Compound404 CAS144-23-0, formula and g/mmol agreement support a source-metadata interpretation of1:1 magnesium hydrogen citrate, but are correlated enrichment rather than independent procurement proof. Prepare distinct CHEBI131389 owner without global Mg-citrate alias; do not reverse #320 or assign all five historical occurrences to it automatically.",
