        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "Full NBRC1378 separately defines FeNaEDTA solution as578mg/L and annotates1.5mM, then adds5ml to medium. Proposed partial stock retains the directly stated mass concentration. The mass/molarity pair must not be used to infer monohydrate; source solute form and the frozen578g/L transcription remain separate unresolved issues.",
