        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "TOGO2809 defines titanium citrate in the LS4D preparation using precursor and carbonate solution steps. The raw titanium-citrate label therefore names a prepared reducing stock, not a pure titanium citrate with known fixed composition; the frozen5g/L cannot substitute for stock addition volume. The complete original TOGO preparation defines500ml0.2M sodium-citrate solution,37.5ml20%w/v TiCl3 solution and100ml8%w/v Na2CO3 under nitrogen. A source-qualified formulation can preserve those batch additions without claiming measured final volume, chemical speciation or an exact pure compound. Existing UNMAPPED_0618 is a distinct generic communitymech source, not proof of the LS4D formulation.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Applies only to frozen case CM_NAME:d5c2ddbc1084d1ed44abdf16a9b3813a68ee1e3463aa7c54b0943c95cff5eb8a, source culturemech, identifier Titanium citrate; every listed recipe context and exact raw/processed label remains bound by case_input_sha256. Matching lexical labels do not extend source identity to unrelated cases. All inherited downstream and complete-payload publication holds remain in force.",
