        "applicability": "Exact source mediadive / mediadive.ingredient:1617; raw label preserved as 'Trypticase soy agar'. The complete raw KG source record, supplier/catalog/condition/amount fields, owners and every embedded downstream hold were assessed. The frozen helper occurrence count is not interpreted as measured recipe prevalence.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
