        "reasoning": "MediaDiveingredient 728 and DSMZ 789 identify diced potato as an input:20 g potato is boiled in 1 L water 30 min, filtered and restored to 1 L. Promote the existing physical-form material owner, not the filtrate. The inherited historical report quotation claiming 200 g/L is preserved as historical prose but explicitly not adopted as current primary evidence. No universal 20 g/L concentration belongs on the tissue owner.",
