        },
        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "DSMZ1009 defines artificial seawater as32gsea salt, for example InstantOcean, in1000mldistilledwater. Both frozen occurrences already preserve the litre dose correctly. The isolated source-qualified stock retains the opaque sea-salt component and water preparation; it cannot resolve to unqualified natural seawater. The generic rawlabel is contextual provenance only, not a resolving synonym.",
