        "reasoning": "DSMZ946a explicitly doses 500 ml of a two-fold synthetic-seawater stock, with its formula reproduced from medium795. The stock includes 55.40 g NaCl, magnesium salts and minor salts per stated stock batch with 1000 mL distilled water added, and is diluted by added water. The frozen 500 G_PER_L label is a volume-unit error. Two-fold stock is not an exact alias of unqualified artificial seawater. An exact isolated source-qualified stock payload is proposed from the complete captured primary formulation. Source-unit defects are tracked separately and do not block this primary-recipe proposal.",
