        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "JCM512 explicitly defines DL minerals as a refrigerated multi-salt/nitrilotriacetate solution; its 10 ml dose is not a mass of a single mineral. The frozen 10 G_PER_L representation and absent inline DL-minerals composition conceal that stock boundary. DL here is a recipe stock name, not stereochemistry. An exact isolated source-qualified stock payload is proposed from the complete captured primary formulation. Source-unit defects are tracked separately and do not block this primary-recipe proposal. The ignored-inclusive native search found Sulfur-free_DL_Minerals; its complete owner uses chloride-based sulfur-free components, whereas JCM512 explicitly includes sulfate salts. They are distinct stocks.",
        "missing_requirement": "Independent review of the complete proposed stock and source-scoped aliases; source-unit repair remains upstream and is not a prerequisite for the isolated proposal.",
        "applicability": "Applies only to culturemech DL minerals (see below) (raw label 'DL minerals (see below)'). All 1 occurrence components and full frozen recipe snapshots were read, including preparation and nested solutions: CultureMech:009904 ingredients/8.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
    "scope_note": "Binding original complete-payload scientific assessments plus actual immutable successor reviews; source-case acceptance alone is not used as owner approval. Historical open findings remain superseded only by separately bound actual corrections."
