        "reasoning": "JCM 99 names larchwood xylan (Sigma) as a material input; MediaDiveingredient 1624 identifies the existing owner. Promote this original owner to a botanical-preparation registry identity, retaining prior history including#294. The prior CHEBI parent was removed for misattributed provenance; newly reviewed CHEBI 37166 still defines a generic xylan polymer, not an exact complete preparation. No exact chemical parent, CAS or purity is needed for this bounded promotion.",
