        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "Stir approximately 300 ml V-8 juice with 3 g CaCO3 for 2 h, then centrifuge and retain the supernatant. NBRC 15 uses 200 ml of that output with 800 ml 2% seawater and 15 g agar. CaCO3 and initial juice volumes are processing inputs, not proven retained output components or concentrations. Final medium pH7.0 belongs to the receiving agar, not an independently measured stock pH. This preparation differs from whole V8 Juice/V8 Canned Vegetable Juice owners.",
        "missing_requirement": "Yield, residual CaCO3 and product lot are unknown; the preparation protocol already defines the authorized isolated material.",
        "applicability": "Applies only to culturemech Vegetable juice (raw label 'Vegetable juice'). All 1 occurrence components and full frozen recipe snapshots were read, including preparation and nested solutions: CultureMech:007955 ingredients/0.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
