        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "Final-review identity correction (#1232): the active exact NCIT:C29298 claim is withdrawn because its colloidal whole-oat fine-powder definition is not established by generic food oatmeal or merely powdered Quaker inputs. The existing food-oatmeal owner is represented by kgmicrobe.ingredient:oatmeal, with NARROW_MATCH to FOODON:00001189 oat food product (a food product made from oats). This is an asymmetric broader food-material grounding, not exact identity with all oat foods and not a new brand or colloidal-grade owner. The prior identifier and exact mapping remain in immutable before bytes and the historical events below; earlier notes describing the retained NCIT hold are historical and superseded by this correction. All30 matching historical normalized recipe contexts at CultureMech15a4da5c08 were inspected in addition to the prior current-source lineage; their oatmeal inputs do not establish colloidal manufacture. The absent untracked18-member table is not claimed reconstructed; occurrence counts remain unchanged pending reconciliation. Powdered Quaker supplied-form facts remain source-specific; generic MediaDive471 oatmeal is not declared powdered. Whole-owner integration/export approval, unresolved occurrence membership and source-specific holds remain.",
