        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "Potato material supplied as tuber tissue in the linked recipes. The material input is distinct from liquid potato infusion or extract after boiling and filtration. Case 16 occurrences carrying peeled-and-cut notes are additionally bound to the more specific peeled/cut material proposal. Starting potato masses are process input amounts, not measured retained solids in a filtrate. FOODON 03315354 names a potato tuber; FOODON 00002796 covers whole/piece derivatives, but no exact claim erases a recipe-specific preparation. JCM 30/54/55/116 and the explicitly qualified frozen rows supply peeled, cut potato as a preparation input. Cut does not specify a dice size, so the existing Diced Potato owner is not an exact substitute. JCM 30 boils 200 g in 1 L for 20 min then sieves; JCM 54/55 combine potato and carrot and filter through cheesecloth. Those outputs remain distinct; the record describes the peeled/cut tissue before extraction.",
        "missing_requirement": "Extraction yield and tissue removal vary by recipe; no single output preparation or finished-medium potato concentration is asserted. Only explicitly peeled-and-cut source occurrences are within this material scope; no inference to unqualified or boiled-extract rows.",
        "applicability": "Applies only to culturemech Potato (raw label 'Potato'). All 28 occurrence components and full frozen recipe snapshots were read, including preparation and nested solutions: CultureMech:004047 ingredients/2, CultureMech:005233 ingredients/0, CultureMech:009702 ingredients/3, CultureMech:008894 solutions/0/composition/0, CultureMech:001520 ingredients/0, CultureMech:002342 ingredients/0, CultureMech:011664 composition/1, CultureMech:012734 composition/0, CultureMech:012760 composition/0, CultureMech:012761 composition/0, CultureMech:012831 composition/0, CultureMech:013105 composition/0, CultureMech:013811 composition/0, CultureMech:014407 composition/0, CultureMech:015206 composition/0, CultureMech:008534 ingredients/3, CultureMech:008445 ingredients/3, CultureMech:001233 ingredients/0, CultureMech:007943 ingredients/3, CultureMech:002667 ingredients/0, CultureMech:008210 ingredients/3, CultureMech:002692 ingredients/0, CultureMech:007942 ingredients/3, CultureMech:003236 ingredients/0, CultureMech:007944 ingredients/4, CultureMech:007945 ingredients/4, CultureMech:007981 ingredients/0, CultureMech:007982 ingredients/0.",
        "source_observations": null
      },
