        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "JCM 30/54/55/116 and the explicitly qualified frozen rows supply peeled, cut potato as a preparation input. Cut does not specify a dice size, so the existing Diced Potato owner is not an exact substitute. JCM 30 boils 200 g in 1 L for 20 min then sieves; JCM 54/55 combine potato and carrot and filter through cheesecloth. Those outputs remain distinct; the record describes the peeled/cut tissue before extraction.",
        "missing_requirement": "Only explicitly peeled-and-cut source occurrences are within this material scope; no inference to unqualified or boiled-extract rows.",
        "applicability": "Applies only to culturemech Potato, peeled and cut (raw label 'Potato, peeled and cut'). All 7 occurrence components and full frozen recipe snapshots were read, including preparation and nested solutions: CultureMech:002908 ingredients/0, CultureMech:002897 ingredients/0, CultureMech:008982 ingredients/3, CultureMech:009858 ingredients/0, CultureMech:009866 ingredients/0, CultureMech:010350 ingredients/4, CultureMech:007606 ingredients/3.",
