        "reasoning": "Add only the supplier-verified C9322 supplied form to the existing cas 9001-05-2 owner. Supplier COA names bovine-liver catalase, lyophilized powder,2,000-5,000 units/mg protein. The retained MeSHD002374 broad parent is species-neutral and #312 human NCITC61062 exclusion remains. Case 42 supplies the exact catalog binding. Case 48 establishes bovine catalase without that catalog; case 141 is generic enzyme reagent. Neither is silently identified with C9322. Existing non-name Properties aliases are not approved by this delta. Historical Catalase (Sigma C--10) is independently corroborated by TOGO M109 and the JCM117 PDF (Sigma C-10,60mg,filter separately); a different catalog number alone is not grounds to reject this catalase label. These recipes do not establish supplier formulation/activity or equivalence to C9322. The C9322 bovine lyophilized supplied form remains supported by its own COA, while NCIT:C61062 human CAT remains excluded under #312. The failed current direct JCM117 and Sigma product requests are recorded as unsuccessful; the existing Catalase payload is retained byte-exact with its whole-owner/export hold.",
