        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "M2843 explicitly says potato extract from 200 g boiled potato per litre. The component surface boiled potato is a preparation-input shorthand, not 200 g/L retained extract solids. The CultureBotHT YAML/current normalized source specifies 4 g/L Infusion from Potatoes plus 20 g/L dextrose; the alternate underscore-name imported record preserves 4 and 20 without units. Neither record supplies an extraction protocol or physical supply-state definition. Neither exact equivalence nor a distinct resulting preparation has been established. Withdraw the duplicate new M2843 owner and add only a source-bounded preparation/supplied-form note to the existing UNMAPPED0251 owner. Do not assign CAS93348-51-7, equate the output to whole tissue, promote the whole owner, or rewrite its earlier occurrence statistics.",
        "missing_requirement": "Existing-owner supply state and preparation lineage are incomplete. M2843 boiling duration, extraction method and yield are also unspecified. The supported source preparation can be recorded without asserting exact equivalence to the two prior owner occurrences.",
        "applicability": "Applies only to culturemech boiled potato (raw label 'boiled potato'). All 1 occurrence components and full frozen recipe snapshots were read, including preparation and nested solutions: CultureMech:009385 ingredients/6.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
    "scope_note": "Binding original complete-payload scientific assessments plus actual immutable successor reviews; source-case acceptance alone is not used as owner approval. Historical open findings remain superseded only by separately bound actual corrections."
