        "reasoning": "TOGO M3120,M2367 andM2277 identify manganese chloride tetrahydrate in the rows whose string reads MnCI2.4H2O. CHEBI:86368 preserves MnCl2·4H2O. Uppercase I is a transcription error for lowercase l in Cl.",
