        "reasoning": "Live ChEBI9532 is chloride-free thiamine(1+)diphosphate and18290 is the chloride salt. The current9532 owner retains chloride formula,InChI,SMILES and chloride aliases from the earlier18290 mapping. Its CAS136-09-4 is not chlorideCAS154-87-0 and must not be removed on the stale combined rationale.",
