        "applicability": "The specific MediaDive778 raw row has no chloride qualifier; its derived mM uses460.768Da and the live page names chlorideCAS/18290,which are automated metadata rather than independent reagent provenance. Propose only repair of owner chemistry/aliases consistent with prior#319/#320; retain9532 mapping,CAS and exact-target WITHHOLD. This owner is shared with worker09 and requires coordinator reconciliation.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
