        "reasoning": "TOGO M2230 primary comments identify M17 fromScharlau ChemieS.A.,Barcelona with20g/Llactose added separately. Register the supplier-named preparation; do not infer basal lactose absence, gel state or standard reconstitution from the added lactose. MICRO2436 denotes DSMZ449 with a specified5g/Llactose recipe, not a verified exact Scharlau product. Scharlab current agar and other vendors broth formulas remain comparisons; no maintained M17 owner exists.",
