        "reasoning": "TOGO M2847 comments name Nissui EagleMEM used as a small amount of homogenization medium, with amphotericinB,penicillin,streptomycin and2%FBS added separately. Its parsed1L row establishes the named preparation context, not proof of a literal experimental liter or a standard reconstitution. Register this supplier preparation without selecting powder05900, salt system, glutamine or bicarbonate additions. Existing generic MEM1377 andMEMalpha owners and the Gibco31095 proposal do not contain this Nissui provenance or establish product equivalence.",
