        "reasoning": "DSMZ535a adds5% blood to medium535 after cooling. The assigned Medium535 input is a whole trypticase-soy-broth-plus-agar formulation, distinct from its isolated agar or added blood.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Exact proposal(s) apply only to frozen case source/occurrence context. DSMZ535 base combines30gtrypticasesoybroth and15gagar per1000ml water, pH7.3;535a adds5%blood. Existing UNMAPPED0557 TrypticaseSoyAgar originates MediaDive1617 and includes currentJCM27 Nissui40g prepared-product occurrences. No exact product equivalence is proven; retain existing general product and distinct DSMZ535 preparation. Named broth vendor alternatives remain source-defined; no molecular identity assigned.",
