        "reasoning": "JCM521 Mineral medium is a five-input basal preparation (sea salts, NH4Cl, sodium sulfate, resazurin, water). Subsequent stock additions include vitamins, pyruvate, bicarbonate, decane and reducing solution. Flattening these would erase which preparation the input denotes.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Exact proposal(s) apply only to frozen case source/occurrence context. JCM521 basalmineral table has fiveinputs andpH7.2–7.4. Vitamins, pyruvate, bicarbonate, decane and reducingstocks addedsubsequently are outsidebase; genericMineralmedium is not a universal alias.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
