          "Completion applies to this report-only scientific review. It does not approve installation, source remapping, inherited whole-owner claims or downstream export. Final assembled/native review remains coordinator-owned.",
          "Conditional HEPES, Wolfe and nominal ethanol handles are not proved-distinct installable substances. Unknown detail does not imply equality or difference.",
