        "reasoning": "MediaDive1846 raw record is the fatty-acid mixture explicitly referencing medium266. JCM266 specifies four named acids, water and NaOH pH adjustment. CHEBI35366 defines the fatty-acid molecular class, not this formulated mixture, so the existing exact owner identity and generic fatty-acid synonyms are unsupported.",
