        "applicability": "Full final materials reassessment, case 39: NBRC 1390 / TOGO M2080 uses 10 ml of whole-fat cow milk. Retain its liquid and fat qualifiers on the existing material; the frozen mass-unit representation is an upstream issue, not evidence of density or dry material.",
