        "reasoning": "The source recipe specifies ATCCMD-TMS, and the current supplier provides an EDTA-based fifteen-solute formulation. Existing ATCC_Wolfes_Mineral_Mix explicitly claims MD-TMS but encodes a different cobalt salt, alum hydration and shorter constituent list from ATCC2672. A catalog-qualified current-formulation proposal preserves this conflict; it does not establish that historical source occurrences used today’s exact formula.",
