        },
        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "ATCC2485 explicitly requests Trace Mineral Supplement catalogMD-TMS,10 ml. The current ATCC product is a sterile multi-salt stock, withEDTA and cobalt nitrate; older Wolfe recipes may instead useNTA and cobalt chloride. Therefore the catalog identifier is the identity anchor and every generic Wolfe-stock name must not be treated as equivalent without version comparison.",
