        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "Hemicalcium D-(+)-pantothenate denotes one-half calcium equivalent per D-pantothenate unit, the same 2:1 D-pantothenate calcium salt represented by CHEBI31345. Official supplier and MediaDive ingredient1123 agree on CAS137-08-6. This supports the raw D-specific alias, but cannot support DL aliases presently on the owner. Four capsaicin names also belong to CHEBI3374 and must be excluded from pantothenate identity matching.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "All seven occurrences retain their individual recipe/solution scopes. Source solution recipes identify constituent1123; this proposal adds the chemical alias and rejects six demonstrably wrong owner labels without certifying imported concentrations, roles or the complete published payload. Exact frozen scopes: CultureMech:001187:ingredients/13; CultureMech:011873:composition/4; CultureMech:012637:composition/5; CultureMech:001278:ingredients/25; CultureMech:000725:ingredients/23; CultureMech:001236:ingredients/10; CultureMech:000843:ingredients/21",
        "source_observations": null
      },
      {
        "worker_slot": 6,
        "binding": {
          "path": "/Users/marcin/Documents/VIMSS/ontology/Mechs/MediaIngredientMech/.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/integration/final-campaign-planning-v1/observed-inputs-v1/snapshot/w06/reports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-06/successor-v5/decisions.json",
          "sha256": "e626c5147747389c1f1125a22d9b09698700b3e5b4f7bc83b42964c9b47ba54a",
