        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The raw hemicalcium D-(+)-pantothenate name and MediaDive CAS137-08-6 agree with stereospecific CHEBI:31345. Half-calcium formula convention is a formula-unit representation, not a different racemate. The damaged KG punctuation is retained as provenance. The baseline owner mixes DL and capsaicin aliases; its WITHHOLD remains and any corrected payload requires a new complete review.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Assigned shard index145; source mediadive.ingredient:1123; exact frozen source_record={\"amount\": 17, \"compound\": \"Hemicalcium D-(+)-pantothenate\", \"compound_id\": 1123, \"g_l\": 0.017, \"optional\": 0, \"recipe_order\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\"}. Assessed all 0 embedded downstream holds without changing them. The case digest preserves full nested provenance; KG helper occurrence counts are not measured recipe frequencies. Shared isolated proposal A-P-CALCIUM-D applies only to the substance/formulation established by this case; it does not approve source-case, owner or export release.",
