        "applicability": "JCM379,381,429,476,709 and710 all support D-glucose as a constituent. JCM381 references379 with a peptone change. The proposal covers chemical aliases only and does not interpret1MGlucose whole-stock cases or resurrect Glucose_2. Exact frozen scopes: CultureMech:009755:ingredients/5; CultureMech:009757:ingredients/5; CultureMech:009814:ingredients/4; CultureMech:009863:ingredients/4; CultureMech:010141:ingredients/1; CultureMech:010142:ingredients/1 JCM381 is now bound to its successful original response body, with the original retrieval index retained separately; neither retrieval timestamp nor source bytes changed.",
