        "applicability": "The single Mitsuhashi-Maramorosch occurrence is a chemical component of the medium, with no salt/hydrate/stock qualifier. Frozen notes explicitly withdraw an unrelated historicalLB expansion; this proposal does not revive that expansion. Exact frozen scopes: CultureMech:008873:solutions/0/composition/3",
