        "applicability": "Both occurrences of the JCM490-derived source are covered. Live JCM490 returned no definition and TOGO491 failed; frozen source bytes and verified ontology identity support the narrow spelling decision. A’s single D-glucose owner proposal must carry this alias and backlink. Shared isolated proposal A-P-D-GLUCOSE applies only to the substance/formulation established by this case; it does not approve source-case, owner or export release.",
