        "reasoning": "JCM1136 and548 separately prepare and add a1MGlucose solution. The source name lacks a D/L or anomer declaration. A1M stock is a preparation distinct from the glucose compound; molarity cannot independently identify stereochemistry or starting hydrate. Successor v3 removes untranscribed Water from the component assertion; only the explicitly named solute and concentration remain as literal transcription.",
