        "reasoning": "JCM1406 calls for20ml of1M glucose solution. This fixes a reagent-stock concentration and addition volume, while leaving the glucose supplied solid form unspecified. Successor v3 removes untranscribed Water from the component assertion; only the explicitly named solute and concentration remain as literal transcription.",
