        "reasoning": "The recovered primary MediaDiveJ576 medium explicitly binds solution4409 and its SL12 stock4411, and JCM576 supplies the full ten-input formula. A specific stock proposal now preserves disodiumEDTA and all source hydrates. DSMZ998 SL12 differs and is excluded. The prior frozen volume-percentage remains tenfold high (1ml/1005ml*100=0.09950248756%).",
