        "reasoning": "The frozen compound1812/SL12 context is linked through CM solution4409. Newly recovered primary MediaDiveJ576 explicitly binds4409 and the separateSL12 stock4411; JCM576 independently prints its ten inputs. The A-authored stock proposal preserves disodiumEDTA and source hydrates. DSMZ998 SL12 differs, so no global SL12 alias or completeness of all unlisted occurrences is asserted.",
        "missing_requirement": "The stock formula for the verified JCM576 context is recovered. Correct the CM tenfold volume-percentage transformation before quantitative integration; preserve unspecified EDTA hydration and do not transfer this formulation to otherSL12 occurrences without source evidence.",
        "applicability": "Exact ingredient1812 and frozen CM solution4409 context are supported by recovered primary JCM576 and MediaDiveJ576 links to the separate SL12 stock4411. Source-specific origin is recovered; retain the CM tenfold concentration-conversion hold and do not extend this composition to other SL12 occurrences or infer EDTA hydration. Shared isolated proposal A-P-JCM576-SL12 applies only to the substance/formulation established by this case; it does not approve source-case, owner or export release.",
