        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "Both source contexts explicitly supply lanthanum chloride heptahydrate. MediaDive ingredient1461 assigns CAS10025-84-0; DSMZ1610 solution9 uses0.04g/L of LaCl3·7H2O. Current CHEBI231515 is lanthanum trichloride without seven waters. Searches of current CHEBI for the hydrate name and CAS did not return a specific hydrate term, so the hydrate keeps a CAS identity and only an asymmetric parent mapping.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "The solution5755 constituent and DSMZ1610 occurrence describe the same seven-water salt; this is not an alias for existing Lanthanum_Iii_Chloride with CAS20211-76-1 and formulaCl3La. No source quantity is used to erase hydration. Exact frozen scopes: CultureMech:014611:composition/1; CultureMech:001092:ingredients/20",
        "source_observations": null
      },
      {
        "worker_slot": 6,
        "binding": {
          "path": "/Users/marcin/Documents/VIMSS/ontology/Mechs/MediaIngredientMech/.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/integration/final-campaign-planning-v1/observed-inputs-v1/snapshot/w06/reports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-06/successor-v5/decisions.json",
