        "reasoning": "DSMZ1429 names Merck108339 Sabouraud2%glucose broth and adds30g/L; the supplier confirms a dehydrated broth composed of two peptone fractions plus20g/L D(+)glucose after reconstitution. The source also adds agar separately, so the broth product itself is not agar medium or pureglucose.",
