        "reasoning": "The raw source specifies Merck108339,2%glucose broth in DSMZ1429. Official supplier composition now verifies the catalog-qualified dehydrated broth, with5g/L meatpeptone,5g/L caseinpeptone and20g/L D(+)glucose at30g product/L. This supports the separate Merckproduct proposal; the receiving recipe adds agar separately. Current typicalcomposition does not establish historicallot invariance or genericSabouraudfamily identity.",
