        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "ATCC1612 uses sterile anaerobic5% sodium-carbonate solution,0.25 ml per10 ml culture medium, to reach pH8.2. Unlike case51, the primary text does not state w/v. It does establish a solution rather than a pure chemical and does not license borrowing the percentage basis from a differently sourced recipe. A bounded ATCC1612 stock proposal retains the literal5% qualification with unspecified basis, rather than treating the missing basis as a blocker to representing the observed preparation. No stock-specific carrier is stated; Water is omitted from the proposed components.",
