        "reasoning": "Both source occurrences use ATCC461 CastenholzTYE medium and the explicitly defined2x salts. The stock contains NTA, Nitsch trace elements, dilute ferric chloride solution, calcium sulfate dihydrate, magnesium sulfate heptahydrate, NaCl, KNO3, NaNO3 and Na2HPO4. A500 ml dose is mixed into the parent medium. The2x factor is relative to that recipe, not a universal salt identity.",
