        "reasoning": "ATCC1047 points to ATCC957 MN marine medium and defines Trace MetalsA5 with0.039 g sodium molybdate dihydrate per litre. Its other salts include boric acid, manganese chloride tetrahydrate, zinc sulfate heptahydrate, copper sulfate pentahydrate and cobalt nitrate hexahydrate. The0.039 g value differs tenfold from the explicitly captured TOGO2601 A5+Co stock; the generic A5 owner cannot choose between versions.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "The one MN marine occurrence uses the ATCC957 formulation through the1047 source. A separate source-qualified stock is proposed; no generic A5 exact alias is added.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
