        },
        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "NBRC113 explicitly specifies Bacto/Difco yeast nitrogen base without both amino acids and ammonium sulfate,1.7 g. The surrounding recipe separately supplies nitrogen and amino-acid additions. This is a formulated commercial basal mixture, distinct from completeYNB and from products omitting only amino acids. The double exclusion must survive normalization. A bounded manufacturer-qualified family proposal preserves both exclusions without assigning the current233520SKU to the historical recipe or inventing a complete formulation.",
        "missing_requirement": "The historical NBRC113 catalogue/lot and full quantitative formulation remain unverified. CurrentBD233520 corroborates family wording only; no completecomposition or historicalSKU identity is asserted, and native source/owner/export release remains separate.",
        "applicability": "The sole TOGO1435 occurrence is sourced toNBRC113; its exact two exclusions are the crucial product boundary. OfficialBD product evidence identifies233520 as the matching double-exclusion product family.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
    "scope_note": "Binding original complete-payload scientific assessments plus actual immutable successor reviews; source-case acceptance alone is not used as owner approval. Historical open findings remain superseded only by separately bound actual corrections."
