        "reasoning": "CrCl3·6H2O unambiguously specifies chromium(III) chloride hexahydrate. CHEBI:53442 is the exact hexahydrate and provides hydratedSMILES/InChI. The existingowner already has the correctidentifier and empiricalformula but retains anhydrous structure strings from an earlierstate. The proposal adds the sourcealias and corrects those structures against theexact ontology term.",
