        "reasoning": "DSMZ135 and339a use sodium carbonate as a 5% w/v solution for anaerobic pH adjustment. The supplied object is a stock, not anhydrous Na2CO3 or the carbonate anion. The current Sodium_Carbonate_Solution owner carries a solute CHEBI identity and lacks a verified formulation, so adding this concentration-bearing string there would perpetuate the stock/solute collapse. No stock-specific carrier is stated; Water is omitted from the proposed components.",
