        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "JCM1435 LN medium and JCM1465 modified NMS4 each say see below but define different trace-metal mixtures. The1435 stock is NTA-based with FeCl2 tetrahydrate, while1465 lists copper sulfate, iron sulfate and other metals at different amounts. The local pointer text cannot be exported as an exact synonym of one formulation. The1465 table also prints H3BO2, which should not be silently corrected. A source-qualified JCM1435 payload now transcribes its full listed inputs and KOH preparation reagent. The source-defined JCM1465 H3BO2 ambiguity remains unresolved; neither source label becomes a global stock alias.",
        "missing_requirement": "Obtain a primary JCM1465 clarification of H3BO2 and preserve its separate formulation before proposing that occurrence. No final chemical speciation or unspecified titrant amount is inferred for JCM1435.",
        "applicability": "CultureMech:015867/JCM1435 alone is covered by B-P-JCM1435-TRACE, with its10ml usage. CultureMech:015872/JCM1465 is retained and explicitly excluded from this stock proposal.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
    "scope_note": "Binding original complete-payload scientific assessments plus actual immutable successor reviews; source-case acceptance alone is not used as owner approval. Historical open findings remain superseded only by separately bound actual corrections."
