        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "JCM977 VNG medium supplies100 ml of20% w/v glucose stock to the basal ingredients. The raw term denotes a 200 g/L glucose stock with unspecified solvent, not a100 g/L pure glucose ingredient. The recipe says Glucose without an anomer or hydrate; the stock proposal preserves that unspecified solute name instead of assigning alpha-D or monohydrate. Successor v3 removes untranscribed Water from the component assertion; only the explicitly named solute and concentration remain as literal transcription.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Applies to the sole TOGO1030 VNG occurrence and its separately sterilized glucose solution; final-medium glucose concentration is not substituted for stock identity. The source-specific stock preparation remains applicable; solvent composition and stock preparation volume are unreported and are not inferred from receiving-medium water or gas handling.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
