        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "DSMZ403 BSK medium specifies Proteose yeastolate (TC), DIFCO5577-15, as a1 g commercial component. Its catalogue number and TC qualification are stronger identity constraints than the generic Proteose yeastolate placeholder. This is a complex commercial preparation; neither a single amino acid nor generic yeast extract is an exact identity. Baseline owner provenance specifically identifies MediaDive460, whose current primary entry points to DSMZ403. This permits a bounded catalogue/form annotation on that established owner, preserving UNMAPPED rather than minting a duplicate or inventing composition.",
        "missing_requirement": "Legacy molecular composition, lot/version details and any successor relationship remain unverified. Those limits do not prevent the bounded source/catalogue annotation; full native changed-owner review and release remain separate.",
        "applicability": "Applies to the sole BSK occurrence and the exact existing source460-derived owner. TC and Difco5577-15 are preserved as source qualifications; no generic global product-successor relationship is claimed.",
        "source_observations": null
      },
      {
        "worker_slot": 6,
        "binding": {
          "path": "/Users/marcin/Documents/VIMSS/ontology/Mechs/MediaIngredientMech/.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/integration/final-campaign-planning-v1/observed-inputs-v1/snapshot/w06/reports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-06/successor-v5/decisions.json",
