          "row_sha256": "5fc70d2210312b3f5c7ef5bd012b6c06a44ebcd575ae0718a73ecc4783c2b914"
        },
        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The frozen attribute retains TC and DIFCO5577-15. DSMZ403/MediaDive solution819 names Proteose yeastolate alongside distinct proteose peptone and tryptone; it is therefore a catalog-defined complex nutrient product, not one of those neighboring ingredients. A current generic yeast-extract term cannot establish equivalence of this historical catalog item.",
        "missing_requirement": "Obtain the historical Difco5577-15 specification or an authoritative successor crosswalk before merging this product with TC255772 or generic yeast extract.",
        "applicability": "Assigned shard index157; source mediadive.ingredient:460; exact frozen source_record={\"amount\": 1, \"attribute\": \"TC) (DIFCO 5577-15\", \"compound\": \"Proteose yeastolate\", \"compound_id\": 460, \"g_l\": 1, \"optional\": 0, \"recipe_order\": 4, \"unit\": \"g\"}. Assessed all 0 embedded downstream holds without changing them. The case digest preserves full nested provenance; KG helper occurrence counts are not measured recipe frequencies. Shared isolated proposal B-P-PROTEOSE-TC5577 applies only to the substance/formulation established by this case; it does not approve source-case, owner or export release.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
