        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "NBRC1402 prints Bactp-YeastNitrogenBase w/oAminoAcids; the supplier identifies a distinct without-amino-acids YNB product. The Bactp typo does not erase the omission qualifier or imply the also-available formulation without ammonium sulfate. A source-qualified without-amino-acids product-family owner is now proposed without retrospective catalogue assignment; incomplete lot chemistry does not prevent this bounded family identity.",
        "missing_requirement": "Bounded product-family payload is supplied. Historical catalogue/lot and full constituent quantities remain unspecified; do not project BD291940 packaging onto these source recipes or remove receiving-medium holds.",
        "applicability": "The one NBRC1402 occurrence is6.7g of this preparation with glucose, water and agar. Source and manufacturer evidence support a complex medium-product interpretation.",
        "source_observations": null
      },
      {
        "worker_slot": 6,
        "binding": {
          "path": "/Users/marcin/Documents/VIMSS/ontology/Mechs/MediaIngredientMech/.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/integration/final-campaign-planning-v1/observed-inputs-v1/snapshot/w06/reports/all_unmatched_20261107/worker-06/successor-v5/decisions.json",
          "sha256": "e626c5147747389c1f1125a22d9b09698700b3e5b4f7bc83b42964c9b47ba54a",
          "selector": "/142",
          "row_sha256": "c74fb41dafdf11a286ec0346110afde0610c145971ddb972e195bc94be0c32e7"
        },
        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "NBRC114 and NBRC111 name Bacto-YeastNitrogenBase withoutAminoAcids(Difco) and then supplies individual amino-acid additions. The manufacturer’s without-amino-acids product supports that formulation class; complete YNB or YNB lacking ammonium sulfate are different products. A source-qualified without-amino-acids product-family owner is now proposed without retrospective catalogue assignment; incomplete lot chemistry does not prevent this bounded family identity.",
        "missing_requirement": "Bounded product-family payload is supplied. Historical catalogue/lot and full constituent quantities remain unspecified; do not project BD291940 packaging onto these source recipes or remove receiving-medium holds.",
        "applicability": "Two occurrences derive from NBRC114; the TOGO M1433/CM007972 occurrence explicitly derives from NBRC111. Both primary tables name the same Difco without-amino-acids family at6.7g, while their separately added amino acids differ. The product-family proposal excludes those receiving-medium supplements.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
