        "reasoning": "The explicit20%(w/v)glucose solution is a defined concentration stock. It is separate from the vitamin stock also used in JCM1009 and cannot be equated exactly with the glucose molecular entity. A concrete source-qualified stock proposal now records the established constituents and preparation limits; incomplete analytical or source metadata does not prevent the bounded proposal. Successor v3 removes untranscribed Water from the component assertion; only the explicitly named solute and concentration remain as literal transcription.",
