        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "NBRC837 defines its starred trace-vitamin stock with ten vitamins and water. The listed amounts agree with the captured JCM197 vitamin table, but the generic starred label is a local footnote marker, not a globally unique stock name. Every constituent and amount has now been compared; the existing source-defined JCM197 payload is extended with NBRC837 evidence and this occurrence backlink.",
