        "reasoning": "Seven JCM recipes explicitly refer to vitamins in Medium197. Current JCM197 provides a ten-vitamin stock. Its calcium-pantothenate label lacks D/L specificity; components must be recorded at the source level. JCM1353 nests this stock inside an additional phosphate-buffered preparation, which is separately reviewed as case39.",
