        "reasoning": "MediaDive5112 (JCM1051) lists the numberedJCM284 vitamin solution as1 ml in a declared1004 ml batch. This is0.0996016% v/v; the frozen0.9960159% value is tenfold higher and must be corrected upstream. Although the API models it as a compound identifier, the primary284 definition is a ten-component stock; the API field type does not convert it to one chemical. ItsDL pantothenate and highB12 distinguish it from197.",
