        "applicability": "OnlyCultureMech:014025 is covered; the exact numbered284 reference links it to the sharedresearch-c payloadC-P-JCM284, preserving1 ml as the primary parent recipe dose and flagging the frozen percentage discrepancy. Shared isolated proposal C-P-JCM284 applies only to the substance/formulation established by this case; it does not approve source-case, owner or export release. W06-IR-002 correction: the generic/providerless stock labels are retained exactly as nonresolving REJECTED_LABEL provenance. Routing remains limited to the explicit source recipe/formulation and occurrence partitions already stated here; qualified stock names do not clear source, dose, owner or export holds.",
        "source_observations": null
      },
