        "reasoning": "All six primary JCM recipes44,45,47,80,103 and104 specify N-Z amine typeA from Sheffield. This supports the typeA product family, not the broader unqualified N-Z_Amine owner. The existing N-Z-Amine_A placeholder is already explicitly a complex protein hydrolysate and the raw typography is a source label variation. Its chemical composition and ontology promotion remain distinct unresolved product-level questions.",
