        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The Allen source defines Na2CO3(4g/L) as4g sodium carbonate with1L deionized water and adds5ml of that stock. The parenthetical concentration therefore belongs to a solution, not a pure salt synonym. A concrete source-qualified stock proposal now records the established constituents and preparation limits; incomplete analytical or source metadata does not prevent the bounded proposal.",
