        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The frozen records4104,4109,8883 are end-product observations in PYGS, with existing source-specific material holds. Independently retrieved primary species-description abstracts (PMID10555335 for frigidicarnis,10826793 for gasigenes,10758868 for algidixylanolyticum) explicitly use peptone/yeast-extract/glucose/starch broth and report fermentation products in it. This corroborates the starch expansion for each of these three exact organism contexts; it does not establish universal PYGS component quantities, source identity approval, or consumption of each constituent. Preserve all three downstream holds.",
