        "applicability": "All three original occurrences remain. Only CultureMech:007471 ingredients/8, source nbrc.medium:1308, occurrence CM_OCC:e689137127cd84bead1063ab24e931745a4a44fb673a953471ea3ab33e3a3df5 uses the reconciled stock (1ml, autoclaved with receiving medium underN2/CO2 80/20). CultureMech:007450 ingredients/8 and CultureMech:007496 ingredients/7 remain exclusively A-P-NBRC1020-824-TRACE. Raw Trace element solution** is occurrence-local. No source file basename is used to infer the NBRC accession.",
        "source_observations": null
