          "row_sha256": "dfa65a3d581b612e368107f184194423533959606d7af1d2f80c2af362078456"
        },
        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "This source-name case combines incompatible preparation scopes: JCM1267 adds 88.8 ml of 10% Fe2(SO4)3 in 0.01 N H2SO4, while NBRC239 lists a 0.005 g ferric sulfate ingredient. The flat JCM occurrence has lost both percentage/solvent and ml. Do not add Fe2(SO4)3 as a universal pure-substance alias across this case. Shared C-P10 provides the concrete nominal 10% ferric sulfate stock in 0.01 N sulfuric acid for only JCM1267-derived CultureMech:002433 and CultureMech:014319/MediaDive5407. The frozen 88.8 G_PER_L and 79.64125560538116 PERCENT_V_V are retained as historical normalization outputs; primary JCM1267 specifies 88.8 ml of prepared stock, not either frozen quantity as a validated final concentration. TOGO M3240 and M1463 remain outside this stock proposal.",
        "missing_requirement": "Split the JCM1267/MediaDive5407 prepared-solution occurrences from the NBRC239 and TOGO M3240 material occurrences; confirm percentage basis and salt hydration for each before source-specific mapping. Remaining non-JCM1267 supplied-form uncertainty and the source normalization/unit conflicts are not resolved by the exact JCM1267 stock proposal.",
        "applicability": "Applies to exact raw source label 'Fe2(SO4)3' and all 4 frozen occurrence objects, each verified against its complete recipe snapshot hash. This source-name case combines incompatible preparation scopes: JCM1267 adds 88.8 ml of 10% Fe2(SO4)3 in 0.01 N H2SO4, while NBRC239 lists a 0.005 g ferric sulfate ingredient. The flat JCM occurrence has lost both percentage/solvent and ml. Do not add Fe2(SO4)3 as a universal pure-substance alias across this case. C-P10 applies only to occurrences CM_OCC:8ac8db7e03c09b3c06e72df935501c21b1a29d08e01ccc87de80ebec985bd944 and CM_OCC:2d4b759d9180c79ba7e227312d92cf102a2185d7cdfa02dfabcacf8f620753f3; it is not a global Fe2(SO4)3 alias and does not settle the separate M3240/M1463 supplied materials.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
