        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "JCM87 actually specifies a 20% lactic-acid titrant as one alternative to hydrochloric acid, used to reach pH5.6. The frozen unqualified label omits the stock strength and alternative-use condition. Do not map this whole source occurrence to a pure lactic-acid enantiomer. A bounded nominal stock proposal now preserves the declared source strength without selecting unreported solvent, percent basis or molecular form.",
