        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "M2298 names nitrilotriacetic acid and supplies C6H9NO6, the neutral acid formula. Trisodium/disodium nitrilotriacetate and their hydrates have different counterion and proton counts, so the acid owner is the exact scope.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Applies only to the exact frozen raw label, occurrence IDs and full captured source contexts enumerated in this decision. Source-scoped subset refinements and proposal occurrence_ids take precedence over generic labels. M2298 names nitrilotriacetic acid and supplies C6H9NO6, the neutral acid formula. Trisodium/disodium nitrilotriacetate and their hydrates have different counterion and proton counts, so the acid owner is the exact scope.",
