        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The exact NaNH4HPO4·4H2O formula is supported by DSMZ694 and Thermo supplier040320.22, CAS7783-13-3, H13NNaO8P. This is a distinct mixed sodium/ammonium hydrogenphosphate tetrahydrate. The ignored-inclusive maintained-record scan found no exact owner; read-only ChEBI255/NCIt26.02d CAS and mixed-salt name queries found no exact term. Propose CAS identity and asymmetric sodium-phosphate class grounding CHEBI:37586, retaining both counterions and four waters; the class is not chemical identity. ROOT supplementary current OLS queries succeeded: separate ChEBI/NCIt searches by CAS and mixed-salt name found no exact term. The lone NCIT name hit C29288 is a potassium/sodium phosphate preparation, not this salt; the sodium-chloride control returned expected terms. This is bounded evidence rather than universal absence.",
