        "reasoning": "MediaDive678 names sodium dihydrogenphosphate dihydrate while reusing anhydrous chemistry. The current MIM local identity explicitly preserves two waters and is distinct from the monohydrate CHEBI:114249. Its active one-water aliases contradict that distinction; source-matched monohydrate cases must not route here.",
