        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The source explicitly names NaH2PO4·H2O. CHEBI:114249 verifies the monohydrate, distinct from both anhydrous phosphate and the dihydrate. The frozen resolving owner is the dihydrate because it carries active one-water synonyms. The live monohydrate owner is Sodium_phosphate_monobasic_monohydrate; Nah2po4h2o is a REJECTED tombstone. Issue758 requires all three monohydrate labels to move together with six source-label overrides and membership-derived counts across the three forms. Isolated payloads are staged parts of that coupled change only; no alias-only application or exact dihydrate promotion is approved.",
