        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "L-Asparagine*H2O names the L monohydrate, CAS5794-13-8. Official NCIT:C87433 contains that CAS, monohydrate formula and exact L-specific synonym. Explicit unique local CAS lookup and native term resolution justify NCIT:C87433 as primary identity with CAS_RN_LOOKUP, superseding the inherited CAS-primary/parent treatment. The DL hydrate and anhydrous L amino acid remain distinct.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Deeply nested P5 MEM stock composition uses1.5g/L in the stock; link the component without treating its stock concentration as final medium concentration. The inherited non-isomeric SMILES is retained only as connectivity/hydration representation; it does not prove racemization. L identity rests on the supported exact form and stereo-specific InChI. No dependent active component uses the replaced CAS ID; generated references remain a later synchronized-integration obligation.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
