        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "Soya flour and soybean flour denote the same generic food material here; supermarket origin does not imply a hydrolysate or specific cultivar. Add the raw Soya spelling to the existing generic flour owner. The inherited Soy flour name resolves through the ontology synonym of soybean flour, so the successor records SYNONYM_MATCH without changing the material identity.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "DSMZ1894/ingredient2443 supplies20g/L Soya flour from supermarket, with mannitol and agar separate.",
        "source_observations": null
      },
