        },
        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "Soya flour from supermarket belongs to the existing generic soybean-flour scope, not soybean peptone. Sharing one alias proposal with the CM case does not collapse two source observations. The inherited Soy flour name resolves through the ontology synonym of soybean flour, so the successor records SYNONYM_MATCH without changing the material identity.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "MediaDive ingredient2443 is the exact same20g/L raw component in primary DSMZ1894; preserve this KG record separately from CM13.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
