        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The frozen source explicitly describes an amphotericin preparation at 10 mg/mL, added by volume. A source-qualified stock record can preserve this preparation with an unresolved amphotericin constituent. The record must not assert amphotericin B, a vehicle or a deoxycholate/lipid formulation.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "MediaDive1140 supplies 0.02 mL and the 10 mg/mL attribute. NCIT:C124792 is excluded because its definition requires amphotericin B, which the source does not establish. The existing generic Amphotericin owner remains unmapped and separate. The named constituent is sufficient to represent the source-qualified stock with UNKNOWN composition closure; the missing congener and vehicle limit narrower identity, not the source-defined preparation.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
