        "reasoning": "ATCC474 independently identifies the fluid thioglycollate ingredient in this Eubacterium recipe as BD211260 at 29.5 g/L. The current BD catalog names BBL fluid thioglycollate medium. This resolves the earlier missing product identification and supports a commercial named-medium owner.",
