        "reasoning": "The primary TOGO M2972 component is explicitly labelled Difco R2A agar, and the preparation describes plant-stem contact with a medium surface. This supports the agar interpretation of this occurrence and a source-provenance enrichment of the existing R2A-agar owner.",
