        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The frozen KG record mediadive.ingredient2431 explicitly names DuchefaL0230 and4.4g addition. Exhaustive current-owner search finds UNMAPPED0427 with the same sourceID despite the frozen name_hits result. Manufacturer L0230 composition/certificate establish a mineral-and-vitamin basal medium, not a vitamin-only supplement. Existing owner alias and product provenance enrichment are justified; a second owner would duplicate the source identity. Issue 1227 correction completes promotion of the same existing UNMAPPED_0427 to the Duchefa L0230 registry preparation, with the manufacturer's 15 dry-product components at their nominal mg/L reconstitution basis. It adds no water, culture supplements, historical lot claim or whole-product ontology shortcut.",
