        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "TOGO M2567 API defines Mineral base C as1 mL10 mM Na2WO4 stock plus1 mL25 mM FeCl3 stock, then adds2 mL baseC to YPS. This is a two-stock preparation rather than either pure tungsten/iron compound. The frozen unit is flattened. The complete immediate source formulation supports an isolated source-qualified registry stock proposal. Its bare local name is retained in scoped notes rather than exported as a global alias.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Exact source case Mineral base C. Reviewed every one of its 1 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:009135 at ingredients/8. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. TOGO M2567 API defines Mineral base C as1 mL10 mM Na2WO4 stock plus1 mL25 mM FeCl3 stock, then adds2 mL baseC to YPS. This is a two-stock preparation rather than either pure tungsten/iron compound. The frozen unit is flattened. The complete immediate source formulation supports an isolated source-qualified registry stock proposal. Its bare local name is retained in scoped notes rather than exported as a global alias.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
