        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "JCM 995 Vitamin solution No. 6 is an explicitly enumerated nine-vitamin stock within Solution 2, including nicotinamide and thiamine hydrochloride dihydrate. Those forms differ from other vitamin stock recipes, so the source-qualified recipe is proposed without collapsing it into generic Vitamin solution or Planctomyces vitamin mix.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Exact source case Vitamin solution No. 6. Reviewed every one of its 1 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:007567 at solutions/1/composition/4. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. JCM 995 Vitamin solution No. 6 is an explicitly enumerated nine-vitamin stock within Solution 2, including nicotinamide and thiamine hydrochloride dihydrate. Those forms differ from other vitamin stock recipes, so the source-qualified recipe is proposed without collapsing it into generic Vitamin solution or Planctomyces vitamin mix.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
