        "reasoning": "CTM JCM1100 vitamin solutionA(1000x) contains thirteen specified compounds, including thiamine pyrophosphate, ascorbate and β-NAD, in100 mL10mM potassium phosphate buffer pH7.2. The separate B stock contains B12. The proposed source-specific A identity preserves these components and excludes B12; A/B are not synonyms.",
