        "applicability": "Exact source case Vitamin solution A (1000 x stock). Reviewed every one of its 1 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:015911 at ingredients/9. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. CTM JCM1100 vitamin solutionA(1000x) contains thirteen specified compounds, including thiamine pyrophosphate, ascorbate and β-NAD, in100 mL10mM potassium phosphate buffer pH7.2. The separate B stock contains B12. The proposed source-specific A identity preserves these components and excludes B12; A/B are not synonyms.",
