        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "The two MPYCY recipes contain the stock inside Solution B. JCM 1037 points to 1036, whose vitamins mix points to JCM 296: seven constituents at 20 mg each and folic acid, B12 and biotin at 1 mg each per 1 L water. This is a ten-vitamin stock, distinct from pure vitamins and from the surrounding Solution B. A source-qualified registry stock is proposed; the generic raw label remains scoped in notes.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Exact source case Vitamins mix solution. Reviewed every one of its 2 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:007620 at solutions/1/composition/1; CultureMech:007621 at solutions/1/composition/1. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. The two MPYCY recipes contain the stock inside Solution B. JCM 1037 points to 1036, whose vitamins mix points to JCM 296: seven constituents at 20 mg each and folic acid, B12 and biotin at 1 mg each per 1 L water. This is a ten-vitamin stock, distinct from pure vitamins and from the surrounding Solution B. A source-qualified registry stock is proposed; the generic raw label remains scoped in notes.",
