        "applicability": "Exact source case Component III. Reviewed every one of its 1 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:009183 at ingredients/2. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. ATCC 1249 primary PDF restores the three separate subpreparations. Component III is sodium lactate 3.5 g and yeast extract 1.0 g in 400 mL DI water, adjusted to pH 7.5 and autoclaved before combining I/II/III. The flattened recipe title is a local preparation label, so the proposal uses an ATCC-qualified stock identity and does not publish bare Component III globally.",
