        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "MediaDive main solution 277 directly references solution 5980, Wolin's vitamin solution (10x). That stock enumerates ten vitamins, including calcium D-(+)-pantothenate and B12 1 mg/L. It is tenfold concentrated relative to common Wolfe-type vitamin recipes and differs from the current Thauer and Wolfe stock owners. A source-qualified stock proposal preserves the complete literal formulation. Issue 1227 peer correction VM1227-PEER-001: the explicit DL component retains its literal name and amount, with exact external reference CHEBI:748116 instead of the broader ChEBI catalog parent. Primary identity evidence and the exact-form lookup are bound; all original occurrence, source, role and export holds remain.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Exact source case Wolin's vitamin solution (10x). Reviewed every one of its 1 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:012076 at composition/17. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. MediaDive main solution 277 directly references solution 5980, Wolin's vitamin solution (10x). That stock enumerates ten vitamins, including calcium D-(+)-pantothenate and B12 1 mg/L. It is tenfold concentrated relative to common Wolfe-type vitamin recipes and differs from the current Thauer and Wolfe stock owners. A source-qualified stock proposal preserves the complete literal formulation.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
