        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "TOGO M2567 API restores Mineral base D as 5 mL 14% (w/v) NH4Cl stock plus 5 mL 7% (w/v) KH2PO4 stock. The source then uses 10 mL base D in YPS. The frozen flat G_PER_L quantity is not a molecular ingredient dose, and D is distinct from bases A–C. The complete immediate source formulation supports an isolated source-qualified registry stock proposal. Its bare local name is retained in scoped notes rather than exported as a global alias.",
