        "applicability": "Exact source case Mineral base D. Reviewed every one of its 1 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:009135 at ingredients/9. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. TOGO M2567 API restores Mineral base D as 5 mL 14% (w/v) NH4Cl stock plus 5 mL 7% (w/v) KH2PO4 stock. The source then uses 10 mL base D in YPS. The frozen flat G_PER_L quantity is not a molecular ingredient dose, and D is distinct from bases A–C. The complete immediate source formulation supports an isolated source-qualified registry stock proposal. Its bare local name is retained in scoped notes rather than exported as a global alias.",
