        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "JCM 848 defines the 100x vitamin mixture with biotin/B12 0.1 g each, pABA 0.3 g, folate/thiamine-HCl/riboflavin 0.5 g each and pyridoxine-HCl 1.5 g per L water. The proposed source-qualified stock preserves 100x and the high stock amounts; these are not final-culture doses or the JCM 1023 pyridoxamine stock.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Exact source case 100 x Vitamin mixture (see below). Reviewed every one of its 1 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:010303 at ingredients/4. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. JCM 848 defines the 100x vitamin mixture with biotin/B12 0.1 g each, pABA 0.3 g, folate/thiamine-HCl/riboflavin 0.5 g each and pyridoxine-HCl 1.5 g per L water. The proposed source-qualified stock preserves 100x and the high stock amounts; these are not final-culture doses or the JCM 1023 pyridoxamine stock.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
