        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "NBRC1356 base2 contains NaCl240 g, NH4Cl0.5 g, K2HPO4 2.5 g, KCl5 g and water1 L at pH7.3. It is mixed 1:1 with the precipitate-cleared carbonate base1 and then supplemented. This accurately resolves the local stock context but is not the final medium, base1, or any single salt. The complete immediate source formulation supports an isolated source-qualified registry stock proposal. Its bare local name is retained in scoped notes rather than exported as a global alias.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Exact source case Mineral base 2**. Reviewed every one of its 1 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:007474 at ingredients/1. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. NBRC1356 base2 contains NaCl240 g, NH4Cl0.5 g, K2HPO4 2.5 g, KCl5 g and water1 L at pH7.3. It is mixed 1:1 with the precipitate-cleared carbonate base1 and then supplemented. This accurately resolves the local stock context but is not the final medium, base1, or any single salt. The complete immediate source formulation supports an isolated source-qualified registry stock proposal. Its bare local name is retained in scoped notes rather than exported as a global alias.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
