        },
        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "JCM1363 explicitly defines an eight-vitamin stock in 100 mL 10 mM phosphate buffer pH7.1, including B12 5 mg, pyridoxine-HCl15 mg and thiamine-HCl10 mg. JCM1364 points to this exact recipe. A shared source-specific stock proposal covers those two cases while keeping JCM403 separate.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Exact source case Vitamin mixture solution* (see below). Reviewed every one of its 1 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:015841 at ingredients/11. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. JCM1363 explicitly defines an eight-vitamin stock in 100 mL 10 mM phosphate buffer pH7.1, including B12 5 mg, pyridoxine-HCl15 mg and thiamine-HCl10 mg. JCM1364 points to this exact recipe. A shared source-specific stock proposal covers those two cases while keeping JCM403 separate.",
        "source_observations": null
      },
      {
        "worker_slot": 8,
        "binding": {
