          "row_sha256": "6a4481ebcc893297faeb318468d04960c6583f976543c8416b3be88629a97e49"
        },
        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "JCM1364 explicitly points to the Vitamin mixture solution of JCM1363. That provides the same complete eight-vitamin phosphate-buffer formulation as case79, including B125mg and pyridoxine-HCl15mg per100mL. The cases share one qualified new stock proposal; neither is equated to JCM403.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Exact source case Vitamin mixture solution* (see Medium No. 1363 ). Reviewed every one of its 1 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:015842 at ingredients/11. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. JCM1364 explicitly points to the Vitamin mixture solution of JCM1363. That provides the same complete eight-vitamin phosphate-buffer formulation as case79, including B125mg and pyridoxine-HCl15mg per100mL. The cases share one qualified new stock proposal; neither is equated to JCM403.",
        "source_observations": null
