        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "Both MediaDive main solutions453 and606 explicitly reference solution608. The stock is a seven-acid volumetric blend: acetic548.5 mL, propionic193.5, butyric129 and n-valeric/isobutyric/DL-2-methylbutyric/isovaleric32.25 mL each. A source-specific mixed-acid identity is proposed, with no exact mapping of the whole blend to one fatty acid. Issue 1227 peer correction VM1227-PEER-001: the explicit DL component retains its literal name and amount, with exact external reference cas:116-53-0 instead of the broader ChEBI catalog parent. Primary identity evidence and the exact-form lookup are bound; all original occurrence, source, role and export holds remain.",
        "missing_requirement": null,
        "applicability": "Exact source case Volatile fatty acid mixture. Reviewed every one of its 2 frozen occurrences: CultureMech:013506 at composition/13; CultureMech:014786 at composition/14. All full recipe snapshots and their source/source-stock pointers are bound as evidence. Both MediaDive main solutions453 and606 explicitly reference solution608. The stock is a seven-acid volumetric blend: acetic548.5 mL, propionic193.5, butyric129 and n-valeric/isobutyric/DL-2-methylbutyric/isovaleric32.25 mL each. A source-specific mixed-acid identity is proposed, with no exact mapping of the whole blend to one fatty acid.",
