        "outcome": null,
        "reasoning": "ATCC 2883 gives the same 1 ml, 0.1 mg/ml, filter-sterilized B12 stock for its agar and broth recipes. Propose one source-qualified partial stock with generic B12 at 100 mg/L, no guessed carrier. The separately added methanol is excluded from stock composition. Issue 1227 distinguishes incomplete knowledge from explicit omitted constituents: the preparation remains supported, but its component completeness is UNKNOWN.",
        "missing_requirement": "Carrier, other stock constituents and molecular vitamer remain unspecified; these limit full chemical decomposition but do not block the supported shared ATCC 2883 preparation.",
        "applicability": "Issue1201 independent-review remediation VM1201-F1; exact original case and every frozen occurrence preserved. ATCC 2883 gives the same 1 ml, 0.1 mg/ml, filter-sterilized B12 stock for its agar and broth recipes. Propose one source-qualified partial stock with generic B12 at 100 mg/L, no guessed carrier. The separately added methanol is excluded from stock composition.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
    ],
