        "reasoning": "The NBRC sources document0.002%(w/v) B12 stocks, which are20 mg/L. Instead of retaining an absolute no-curation block for unknown carrier, connect this case as a conditional comparison to the concrete JCM 51520 µg/ml partial-stock proposal. No NBRC occurrence is assigned that owner: equal concentration and filtration do not establish shared preparation, and no separate owners are invented merely for different source numbers. Issue 1227 distinguishes incomplete knowledge from explicit omitted constituents: the preparation remains supported, but its component completeness is UNKNOWN.",
