        "reasoning": "The four JCM recipes name2 mg/ml B12 stock; JCM 647 explicitly filter sterilizes it before post-autoclave addition. Propose that concrete JCM 647 partial preparation at literal2000 mg/L generic B12. Other JCM 520/533/650 occurrences are conditional comparisons only because no common stock protocol is supplied. Issue 1227 distinguishes incomplete knowledge from explicit omitted constituents: the preparation remains supported, but its component completeness is UNKNOWN.",
        "missing_requirement": "Recover explicit shared stock provenance or complete formulations before assigning the other three occurrences to the JCM 647 owner. The written2 mg/ml is not silently corrected; carrier and molecular vitamer remain unknown.",
        "applicability": "Issue1201 independent-review remediation VM1201-F1; exact original case and every frozen occurrence preserved. The four JCM recipes name2 mg/ml B12 stock; JCM 647 explicitly filter sterilizes it before post-autoclave addition. Propose that concrete JCM 647 partial preparation at literal2000 mg/L generic B12. Other JCM 520/533/650 occurrences are conditional comparisons only because no common stock protocol is supplied.",
        "source_observations": null
      }
