        "reasoning": "The four UTEX occurrences are components of ES enrichment stock, with beta positional identity, two sodium ions and five waters explicit. Their source annotations give CAS13408-09-8. This is the existing disodium glycerol2-phosphate pentahydrate, distinct from anhydrous CHEBI132089 and glycerol3-phosphate. The proposed synonym names the nested solute, not the complete seawater or enrichment stock.",
