        "applicability": "Reviewed this exact case 'Foetal calf serum', its 2 frozen occurrence(s), and each enclosing recipe at the listed component/stock path. Primary evidence is attached only for the source recipes, definitions and processing contrasts relevant to this case. Propose the British spelling Foetal calf serum on the existing Fetal_Bovine_Serum owner only; retain both source occurrences and do not extend this decision to treated or newborn serum.",
