        "applicability": "JCM391 explicitly crossreferences the vitamin solution in JCM403. Direct JCM403 lists100mL sodium phosphate buffer10mM,pH7.1 in that solution; its separate thiamine solution uses25mM,pH3.4. MediaDiveJ391 expands the same crossreference, so it is derivative corroboration. This source-qualified stock preserves printed concentration/pH without inferring salt ratios, hydrate forms, titrant, solvent chemical identity or hidden water amounts.",
